        "controller_support": "full",
        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Puzzle</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To deduce the correct positions for symbols on the game board. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 rules styles, each of them requires unique deciphering technique. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 game board sizes: 5x5, 7x7, 9x9, 11x11 and 13x13. From speedy run to mind boggling difficulty to suit all tastes. </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Game</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlike other similar board-based puzzles, no exact solution required. As long as your placement fits all rules the puzzle is solved. The ability to identify equally valid placements fast is an definite advantage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >40+ achievements to unlock!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15 leaderboards for all styles and board size combinations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Comes with a good set of symbols having their own charm. Always feel fresh when playing with a different set of symbols each time. Or face the ultimate challenge of using all symbols from every set in a single game!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Import and play using your own symbols. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No progression and no grinding. Always ready for a quick fun game session every once in a while with no pressure. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full native gamepad support. The game is fully playable solely with mouse, keyboard or gamepad. You could even mix and use all 3 at the same time to fit your habit.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >No Early Access?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >My idea is early access means gameplay will likely be massive changed, but Kaidogaku the puzzle is essentially completed. QoLs and bugfixes will come but I rather not give empty promise on new content. I do intended to keep the game alive and will add new gameplay elements if I found they are fun. No DLC is planned. I would assure new updates will always be part of the full game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >In baking/brainstorming</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nice to have features, are under baking:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weekly/Daily challenge with a fixed set of symbol distribution, to see how well you compete with other players under the same circumstances. Need more play data to fine tune the  experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >User adjustable puzzle generator</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New placement rules and board configurations, in very early brainstorming stage. </p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Puzzle</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To deduce the correct positions for symbols on the game board. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 rules styles, each of them requires unique deciphering technique. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 game board sizes: 5x5, 7x7, 9x9, 11x11 and 13x13. From speedy run to mind boggling difficulty to suit all tastes. </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Game</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlike other similar board-based puzzles, no exact solution required. As long as your placement fits all rules the puzzle is solved. The ability to identify equally valid placements fast is an definite advantage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >40+ achievements to unlock!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15 leaderboards for all styles and board size combinations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Comes with a good set of symbols having their own charm. Always feel fresh when playing with a different set of symbols each time. Or face the ultimate challenge of using all symbols from every set in a single game!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Import and play using your own symbols. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No progression and no grinding. Always ready for a quick fun game session every once in a while with no pressure. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full native gamepad support. The game is fully playable solely with mouse, keyboard or gamepad. You could even mix and use all 3 at the same time to fit your habit.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >No Early Access?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >My idea is early access means gameplay will likely be massive changed, but Kaidogaku the puzzle is essentially completed. QoLs and bugfixes will come but I rather not give empty promise on new content. I do intended to keep the game alive and will add new gameplay elements if I found they are fun. No DLC is planned. I would assure new updates will always be part of the full game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >In baking/brainstorming</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nice to have features, are under baking:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weekly/Daily challenge with a fixed set of symbol distribution, to see how well you compete with other players under the same circumstances. Need more play data to fine tune the  experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >User adjustable puzzle generator</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New placement rules and board configurations, in very early brainstorming stage. </p></li></ul>",
        "short_description": "Kaidogaku is a symbolic deduction puzzle game. Decipher the positions for all symbols by make use of a list of placement rules. No progression no grinding just straight and simple fun to immerse in thought and lose the sense of time passing. ",
